	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "TDK ANT016008LCS2442MA2 2.4 GHz multilayer chip antenna, 1.6x0.8x0.4mm, land per LCSC/EasyEDA C209892. Pad 4 = FEED (marked by fab chamfer), pad 1 = radiator-pattern end, pads 2/3/5/6 dummy. REQUIRES: 6.0 x 2.5 mm keep-out with GND removed on ALL layers at a board corner/edge (TDK layout example), the printed antenna pattern extension per datasheet, Ft (freq tune, eval 2.0 nH 0603) + Mt (match, eval 3.0 nH 0603) slots, 0.2 mm ground stitching vias along the clearance boundary, 50 ohm feed. VNA tune on the real stackup mandatory.")
